# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Copied verbatim from public/ into dist/ by Vite.
#
# Each client-side route is answered with the single page application (status 200: a rewrite, the
# address does not change). The destination is `/`, not `/index.html`: Pages redirects
# `/index.html` to `/` (308), so a rewrite to it ends as a redirect and a reload of /learn lands on
# the trainer (ADR 039). A trailing slash is the same route.
#
# There is deliberately no catch-all: an unknown path or a missing /assets/* file falls through to
# 404.html and a real 404 status. A test keeps this list equal to ROUTE_PATHS in
# src/app/route-paths.ts.

/type / 200
/type/ / 200
/stats / 200
/stats/ / 200
/settings / 200
/settings/ / 200
/about / 200
/about/ / 200
